<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 599" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace">
<title id="title">USEFUL WORK, HUMAN STORY</title>
<desc id="desc">Four illustrated stages connect documented useful work to a truthful human story, possible platform distribution and continued service to readers. A useful story may reach people, but no post is guaranteed an audience. Respect consent and preserve the actual instructions beyond the feed.</desc>
<rect width="480" height="599" fill="#ffffff"/>
<text x="20" y="31" font-size="20" fill="#17251f" text-anchor="start" font-weight="600">USEFUL WORK, HUMAN STORY</text>
<path d="M20 46L460 46" fill="none" stroke="#9a4f13" stroke-width="2"/>
<text x="20" y="78" font-size="14" fill="#4b5b52" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">A publishing sequence, not an audience formula.</text>
<text x="112" y="131" font-size="14" fill="#17251f" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">1. DOCUMENT THE WORK</text>
<text x="112" y="158" font-size="14" fill="#4b5b52" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">Parts, steps, errors and repairs.</text>
<path d="M54 177L54 199" fill="none" stroke="#a2afa6" stroke-width="1.6"/>
<path d="M50 193L54 199L58 193" fill="none" stroke="#a2afa6" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<text x="112" y="232" font-size="14" fill="#17251f" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">2. TELL THE TRUE STORY</text>
<text x="112" y="259" font-size="14" fill="#4b5b52" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">Show the people with their consent.</text>
<path d="M54 278L54 300" fill="none" stroke="#a2afa6" stroke-width="1.6"/>
<path d="M50 294L54 300L58 294" fill="none" stroke="#a2afa6" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<text x="112" y="333" font-size="14" fill="#17251f" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">3. OFFER IT TO THE FEED</text>
<text x="112" y="360" font-size="14" fill="#4b5b52" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">Distribution may bring new readers.</text>
<path d="M54 379L54 401" fill="none" stroke="#a2afa6" stroke-width="1.6"/>
<path d="M50 395L54 401L58 395" fill="none" stroke="#a2afa6" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<text x="112" y="434" font-size="14" fill="#17251f" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">4. KEEP THE WORK USABLE</text>
<text x="112" y="461" font-size="14" fill="#4b5b52" text-anchor="start" font-weight="400">Answer, correct, archive and repeat.</text>
